@host = http://localhost:5167

GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Register a track (no audio file needed); artists by name or by artistId
POST {{host}}/api/tracks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Blue Monday", "version": "12-inch mix", "artists": [{ "name": "New Order", "role": "Main" }] }

### List tracks: search (title, version, artist), hasAudio, page, pageSize (max 100)
GET {{host}}/api/tracks?search=monday&hasAudio=false&page=1&pageSize=25

### Track detail
GET {{host}}/api/tracks/1

### Replace a track's metadata and artists
PUT {{host}}/api/tracks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Blue Monday", "version": null, "artists": [{ "artistId": 1, "role": "Main" }] }
